### DELETE - Remove player from group (204)
DELETE {{api}}/groups/{{groupId}}/players/{{playerId}}
Authorization: {{token}}

### NEGATIVE - 404 (player not in group)
DELETE {{api}}/groups/{{groupId}}/players/77777777777
Authorization: {{token}}

### NEGATIVE - 403 (other user deletes player)
DELETE {{api}}/groups/{{groupId}}/players/{{playerId}}
Authorization: {{otherToken}}

### NEGATIVE - 403 (other user deletes group)
DELETE {{api}}/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: {{otherToken}}

### NEGATIVE - 404 (delete missing group)
DELETE {{api}}/groups/99999
Authorization: {{token}}

### DELETE - Remove group (204)
DELETE {{api}}/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: {{token}}
